+# Phial
+
+Run development machines safely.
+
+<br/>
+
+[![Please do not theme this app](https://stopthemingmy.app/badge.svg)](https://stopthemingmy.app)
+[![Flatpak CI](https://codeberg.org/pojntfx/phial/badges/workflows/flatpak.yaml/badge.svg)](https://codeberg.org/pojntfx/phial/actions)
+![Go Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/go%20version-%3E=1.25-61CFDD.svg)
+[![Go Reference](https://pkg.go.dev/badge/codeberg.org/pojntfx/phial.svg)](https://pkg.go.dev/codeberg.org/pojntfx/phial)
+[![Matrix](https://img.shields.io/matrix/phial:matrix.org)](https://matrix.to/#/#phial:matrix.org?via=matrix.org)
+[![Weblate translation status](https://hosted.weblate.org/widget/phial/svg-badge.svg)](https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/phial/)
+
+## Overview
+
+Phial runs virtual machines on your desktop. Secrets and private keys stay on the host.
+
+It enables you to:
+
+- **Create and install virtual machines** with CPU, memory, disk, and network settings
+- **Grant time-boxed access to tokens, SSH keys, and GPG keys** without copying them to the machine
+- **Pass USB devices and shared folders** to a machine
+- **Open a window with waypipe or a desktop with RDP**
+
+## Installation
